abstract: >
  A framework for epistemic integrity in AI systems — structural tools for closing
  the honesty gap through the observer/witness principle, across any domain.
  Includes the observer core spec, witness integrity proofs, escalation trigger,
  consensus deliberation, and observer ledger primitives.
